      "claim": "No escalation trigger fires, and the case should be decided on the money rather than held. The identifiers match across trip_record, gps_trace and fare_breakdown, so POL-RD-10(2) is not engaged; the trace is unimpaired, so POL-RD-10(3) is not engaged; the driver names no evidence ID for any advisory, so POL-RD-13(1) keeps the absent advisory out of POL-RD-10(5) - an assertion that cites no artifact cannot be invoked against one; and the computed refund of 3.95 is far below the SGD 150.00 ceiling in POL-RD-10(6).",
      "side": "RIDER",
